# Infrastructure

Implement `Core.Contracts` only. Do not leak EF types into Application or API beyond the composition root.

**Ask first** before: new/changed DbSets, Fluent API, migrations, repositories, or packages (EF, JWT, Google, mail, cache, messaging).

Repositories stay focused; saves go through `IUnitOfWork`.
